``yield/uspto_yield.csv.gz`` is a modified, normalized table derived from
Alexander Minidis's yield-curated USPTO Figshare archive, itself based on
Daniel Lowe's CC0 USPTO extraction. The redistributed curated table remains
under the Figshare record's MIT license. Preserve this notice and cite both
source records:

- https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.14414039.v1 (MIT)
- https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.5104873.v1 (CC0-1.0)

Copyright (c) 2021 Alexander Minidis. The MIT permission grant and warranty
disclaimer printed above apply to this MIT-licensed source as well.


Selectivity dataset notices
---------------------------

``selectivity/hitea_chiral_resolution.csv.gz`` is derived from the same pinned
HiTEA source and MIT terms printed above for ``yield/hitea.csv.gz``. Cite
King-Smith et al., Nature Chemistry 2024, DOI
``10.1038/s41557-023-01393-w``. The selectivity subset retains only chiral salt
resolution rows with positive reported product yield and a product-ee measurement.

``selectivity/regiosqm_eas.csv.gz`` is a modified table from the Jensen Group
``db-regioselectivity`` database at commit
``f734ce480c61608c636c5d4c0e9866f6bcbbb9a9``. The repository contains the
database files and describes their experimental EAS centers; its root license
declares MIT. Cite Kromann et al., Chemical Science 2018, DOI
``10.1039/C7SC04156J``.

